### Login como "student" (scope: blueprints.read)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "student123"
}

### Login como "assistant" (scope: blueprints.read blueprints.write)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "assistant",
  "password": "assistant123"
}

### Login con credenciales inválidas (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### Listar todos los blueprints (requiere blueprints.read)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blueprints
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Listar blueprints de un autor (requiere blueprints.read)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blueprints/john
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Consultar un blueprint puntual (requiere blueprints.read)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blueprints/john/house
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Crear un nuevo blueprint (requiere blueprints.write; con token de "student" responde 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blueprints
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "student",
  "name": "Nuevo Plano",
  "points": [ { "x": 0, "y": 0 }, { "x": 5, "y": 5 } ]
}

### Agregar un punto a un blueprint existente (requiere blueprints.write)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/blueprints/john/house/points
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 99,
  "y": 99
}

### Petición sin token (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blueprints
